===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# any of several [[Oriental]] and [[American]] [[tree]]s, of the [[genus]] {{taxfmt|Liquidambar|genus}}, having [[brilliant]] [[autumn]] [[coloration]]; their [[wood]] is used for [[furniture]], [[woodpulp]] and [[plywood]]
## {{taxfmt|Liquidambar styraciflua|species}}, the [[sweet gum tree]].

